{#
    drv_cli.c.j2 - CLI debug shell driver implementation
    Interactive UART-based command shell for STM32G0B1 / FreeRTOS.

    Architecture:
      UART RX ISR → LwRB ring buffer → cli_rx_sem
           ↓
      cli_task  →  hw2c_cli_input(ch)   (line edit, VT100, history, tab)
           ↓
      hw2c_cli dispatch  →  wrapper  →  old-style cmd_handler(argc, argv, cli_output)

    All line-editing, history navigation, and tab completion are
    delegated to hw2c_cli.  Command handlers retain the legacy
    cli_output_fn signature for backward compatibility.
#}

